# No Cursor commit attribution

Never add, keep, or push any Cursor co-author attribution.

Forbidden in commits and PRs:
- `Co-authored-by: Cursor`
- `cursoragent@cursor.com`
- `--trailer` with Cursor / cursoragent
- "Made with Cursor"

Author and committer must be the user only.

## After every `git commit` (mandatory)

Cursor may inject a co-author trailer automatically. Immediately:

1. `git log -1 --format='%B'`
2. If the body mentions Cursor / cursoragent / `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, strip it before doing anything else
3. Prefer rewrite via `git filter-branch` / `commit-tree` / equivalent — do not leave a dirty HEAD

## Before every `git push` (mandatory)

1. `git log -1 --format='%B'` (and scan commits being pushed)
2. Do not push until every commit body is clean of Cursor attribution

